 "id": "1280906564113879", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819356_1280906570780545_4249318822798510746_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PBOy3s27muYQ7kNvwFkJElt&_nc_oc=AdrE30Y0TokDTYjbOOu4MwYX9WqvttlyVMwfYMsglLR_l0GfM0a7m0j3bXWvAsaKcrE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ8i8roxhc0AvIqN3AdBIObp3PwCcfUH3C_MFKO04tsog&oe=6AEDE50B"}, {"file_name": "SS2.png", "id": "1506219391176821", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1506219394510154_2487401207454887292_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QKVzOpjwoysQ7kNvwEzbvMs&_nc_oc=AdrfjuB-nVnKA_ZXdNYG_XanETaXFWA7K7IRpU4Ca7OilxjxnO9RSbNUQi2jmwG25mA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSAkI9P7ecK_VJnhJDrj1gEGAfz5O59w1Y-WokUeZEFPg&oe=6AEDED5F"}, {"file_name": "SS3.png", "id": "2181921189249811", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_2181921192583144_8744472015256948115_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8gLNcaEw7soQ7kNvwHBXqwA&_nc_oc=AdpSWm_UYvR8G1sUhP72wVCm1WTBOThXBfDA7OfWHHA1_aOXM3-3mPvvf7ag0BncF8c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ_fIdRg9HHf20vJboMLEXZdcp0gtg93LCVFHeCrUCrJg&oe=6AEE02A2"}, {"file_name": "SS1.png", "id": "971915291879896", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824671_971915298546562_8886183350158453239_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BrMYjWBkA1oQ7kNvwHF3moG&_nc_oc=AdpPnEafy7cUyPMKA4e3nICgw0wMuAJIh7wGROhYjDRkmzazr8BVhrRaV6_OLB2UKI8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQTXojtx-_aU8WXCyhvxJ7x0oUUXvcdGYOdGDLvBPiz3g&oe=6AEE0A8C"}, {"file_name": "SS4.png", "id": "1335145861826819", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_1335145865160152_3227708020367008123_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fdj7IdMiyrUQ7kNvwGyvDf6&_nc_oc=AdopI-EmlbZqixQtigI_M6AfsTNR-kMVVfMVObZP9fYDAR0yWx0VYq2rAYxcwI29f6A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQtoAyHmyClmNEosYT5KzWPGVc5i5OWPgkh4AEOjucC8A&oe=6AEDFC97"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Football Guru VR", "keywords": ["football", "soccer", "sport", "sports"], "long_description": "FOOTBALL GURU is the ultimate VR penalty kick experience built for players who crave real pressure, real precision, and real skill.\n\nStep into a packed stadium. Hear the crowd. Feel the tension. It\u2019s just you, the ball, and the goalkeeper staring you down.\n\nIn FOOTBALL GURU, every shot is fully physics-driven and controlled by your real movement. Aim, adjust your angle, control your power, and strike naturally using intuitive VR controls. Curve it into the top corner. Smash it down the middle. Fake the keeper and slot it home with ice-cold confidence.\n\nBut this isn\u2019t just about kicking hard.\n\nYou\u2019ll face increasingly intelligent goalkeepers who study your patterns and adapt to your play style. Mix up your strategy. Control your nerves. Outthink the keeper before you outshoot him.\n\nFeatures:\n\nRealistic, physics-based penalty kicks\n\nImmersive stadium environments with dynamic atmosphere\n\nProgressive difficulty with smarter, faster goalkeepers\n\nScore challenges and competitive leaderboards\n\nSkill-based gameplay with no gimmicks, no randomness\n\nWhether you\u2019re chasing the perfect top-corner strike or grinding to dominate the leaderboard, FOOTBALL GURU rewards mastery, consistency, and mental toughness.\n\nPressure creates legends.\n\nStep up. Strike true. Become the Guru.", "short_description": "FOOTBALL GURU puts you on the spot in the ultimate VR penalty kick challenge. Step up, lock in, and strike like a pro as you face increasingly skilled goalkeepers in immersive stadium environments.\n\nMaster precision, timing, and mind games to outsmart the keeper and climb the global leaderboards.\n\nNo shortcuts. No gimmicks. Just you, the ball, and the pressure.\n\nDo you have what it takes to become the Guru?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "xsq3.png", "id": "1693748555383564", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499309014_1693748558716897_163925014469277382_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xp7bQ6SpuLoQ7kNvwFhHf3D&_nc_oc=Adrr2frnNXoTEW2NjvcX64EpD9TU1N_vtBhe3BsQQwZ_mOI8hdw5ZkLbcdcZgHhKJNc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRiENvHZ4J1V44GAwURhD5_nJkMMOZDbcUqeMcmc8YytQ&oe=6AEDD75A"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Portrait 3.png", "id": "1671790997169414", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304019_1671791000502747_1026206423462727886_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7HOwZJDVFQIQ7kNvwE8FLCa&_nc_oc=AdpHsPZ3IOosaUFnHbdflHjWN_L3zvnWQFauEGIF7ZjArhqzKZZar4ZftkXzMUEvtMk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQH47KT1_zRHIjUfI7IP1_-07AUaetloqvLcmLWzztYFQ&oe=6AEDEF2D"}, {"file_name": "xhero2.png", "id": "1631009547980478", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819982_1631009551313811_5076129146527767960_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pWN_lwxmAF4Q7kNvwEheXnk&_nc_oc=AdoEqNlwj40j5FwrrATiUf8sOT3fj4B5vVHxzGVJhUPBALlV3gGPoUeSqjd2c4NvEpg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTwzpJOM8LahQp9_O3UVxzwoC6oKqE6HKahXE7BlePBTg&oe=6AEDED0B"}, {"file_name": "xmain banner.png", "id": "1307320227399654", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1307320230732987_758056680734044219_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tVG7gKQ-TagQ7kNvwHWerp_&_nc_oc=AdoRNS-cirAvBaAOfykRSMIzk3WZQEC6UwotiHNqXMYtnZtGSUA6fB6E-57LYrvRJrk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQxK2BijMdDX5FnWy5sH0yey70-w93Uj1c9BwjTglgmww&oe=6AEDD43C"}, {"file_name": "xico.png", "id": "851158670711741", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_851158674045074_5093440868712470085_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AtahfnHqY48Q7kNvwGOxH1a&_nc_oc=AdoASmcl6HIYkTlZW3qkh14eYaRtbpi9CV2r7bl_Q4EpFJ716i_84cFRoYMPsuajVJk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSTZ_kBU_Xya67792lwH9gjw-xAfEPtR8vfsNJwJO0v3g&oe=6AEDD4F2"}]}, "id": "980204168111239", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "SS5.png", "id": "873269841840096", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823286_873269845173429_8256735349116239178_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bbBe5Dt_24UQ7kNvwEs_6BE&_nc_oc=AdoPXVYw-l945feJWubpPSluf8J1yjQAGnoBgGAmSGZmRbPziSy-l_rRu3MoTfyPSmM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQcP9_r4a3EPWS0JCqUAdP0CAanVQdlt3lTv64Df3oVEQ&oe=6AEDF055"}, {"file_name": "SS3.png", "id": "2176145762948509", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303672_2176145766281842_8400767775707542785_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e-ErzXHBU-wQ7kNvwENE_FH&_nc_oc=AdrV7G4mEHMvsdKgeKcNry0z5IkE_76z7Pq1EnUZb4HmaaSrTFy8TFAzEX2jPqce6Rs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR7cKdv-Jc_gXeVJJWyNTtvp8DZRWOU_08-qCrbC8ANEQ&oe=6AEE0831"}, {"file_name": "SS2.png", "id": "1335379885121071", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307931_1335379891787737_7260425370113492086_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o0WxKWLpCDMQ7kNvwF9ifEs&_nc_oc=AdpICTOaELFtWKhFyNYRMHDS9rQe6cv0lbrrXrMdQ05_kcFIdwXj5kIglpFqnDaJN9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRl36OmplLHV3BNamRWwHsspA6zzZkeep6FUlveBU2bXA&oe=6AEDD837"}, {"file_name": "SS1.png", "id": "2877657719241729", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304952_2877657722575062_5745411639535837970_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dQUq_KZ75HIQ7kNvwGKl9Ui&_nc_oc=Adr5dwS_yqU1EvCqrxRLc2wmfMMmLIX4cEnln7nPE3oNypR3xypTBjM6qzu3WvnssYw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQBJqEwsfmvBEdvp5k4ZDoLLSLgvWRx0Npb3qId-8XB8g&oe=6AEDD6A7"}, {"file_name": "SS4.png", "id": "953935710867379", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820141_953935714200712_3469739723138263185_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X-sH39RR_Z4Q7kNvwH_FKee&_nc_oc=AdrSNmqVgVh5fKz2L0NQH0vL8vbkveIlZHcd0-wZ6E5nXPtntx5yGmX-WQ8YlE5Lhbo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQkhZyTBDKTRu18t4opPtg6-fsCrmf2AKi8aLRyrBqLhQ&oe=6AEDFF4D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "F\u00fatbol Guru VR", "keywords": ["futbol", "f\u00fatbol", "guru"], "long_description": "F\u00daTBOL GURU es la experiencia definitiva de penaltis en VR, creada para jugadores que buscan presi\u00f3n real, precisi\u00f3n real y habilidad real.\n\nEntra en un estadio lleno. Escucha a la multitud. Siente la tensi\u00f3n. Solo est\u00e1is t\u00fa, el bal\u00f3n y el portero mir\u00e1ndote fijamente.\n\nEn FOOTBALL GURU, cada disparo est\u00e1 completamente basado en f\u00edsicas y controlado por tu movimiento real. Apunta, ajusta el \u00e1ngulo, controla la potencia y golpea de forma natural con controles intuitivos en VR. Col\u00f3cala en la escuadra. Revienta el centro. Enga\u00f1a al portero y define con sangre fr\u00eda.\n\nPero esto no va solo de chutar fuerte.\n\nTe enfrentar\u00e1s a porteros cada vez m\u00e1s inteligentes que analizan tus patrones y se adaptan a tu estilo de juego. Var\u00eda tu estrategia. Controla los nervios. Supera al portero mentalmente antes de superarlo con el disparo.\n\nCaracter\u00edsticas:\n\nPenaltis realistas basados en f\u00edsicas\nEstadios inmersivos con atm\u00f3sfera din\u00e1mica\nDificultad progresiva con porteros m\u00e1s r\u00e1pidos e inteligentes\nDesaf\u00edos de puntuaci\u00f3n y clasificaciones competitivas\nJugabilidad basada en habilidad, sin trucos ni aleatoriedad\n\nYa sea que busques el disparo perfecto a la escuadra o dominar la clasificaci\u00f3n, FOOTBALL GURU recompensa la maestr\u00eda, la constancia y la fortaleza mental.\n\nLa presi\u00f3n crea leyendas.\n\nDa el paso. Golpea con precisi\u00f3n. Convi\u00e9rtete en el Guru.", "short_description": "F\u00daTBOL GURU te pone bajo presi\u00f3n en el desaf\u00edo definitivo de penaltis en VR. Da un paso al frente, conc\u00e9ntrate y dispara como un profesional mientras te enfrentas a porteros cada vez m\u00e1s h\u00e1biles en estadios inmersivos.\n\nDomina la precisi\u00f3n, el timing y el juego mental para superar al portero y escalar en las clasificaciones globales.\n\nSin atajos. Sin trucos. Solo t\u00fa, el bal\u00f3n y la presi\u00f3n.\n\n\u00bfTienes lo que hace falta para convertirte en el Guru?"}]}, "developer_name": "The Lonely Developer", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.clarovr.com/torneos/futbolguruvr/legals", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ITBAF", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://planeta.guru/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28144231278511560"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2